# vm/test-guest/ — artifact ignore list.
#
# The committed artifact of this tree is the REPRODUCIBLE BUILDER + scripts +
# tests + docs — NEVER the image/seed blobs. All blobs live under
# $TG_ARTIFACT_DIR (~/tmp/ds-test-guest, btrfs/CoW), never in the repo. These
# globs are belt-and-suspenders in case anyone runs the builder with the output
# pointed at this directory: nothing image-shaped is ever committable.
#
# NEVER commit (per the wave hard rule: no blobs/images, no file >1MB):
*.qcow2
*.qcow2.*
*.img
*.iso
*.raw
vmlinuz*
initramfs*
initrd*
*.kernel
*.cpio
*.cpio.gz
*.sha256
*.sha512
*.asc

# Local artifact / seed-staging dirs if ever created under this tree.
artifacts/
seed-inputs-*/
seed-*/
